<title>EGYPT: Egyptian bank proposing 150 mln pound bond issue.</title>
<headline>Egyptian bank proposing 150 mln pound bond issue.</headline>
<dateline>CAIRO 1997-04-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>The board of Egypt Arab African Bank/EAAB is proposing the bank issue bonds worth 150 million pounds ($44 million) to finance an expansion in operations, the bank said in an announcement on Sunday.</p>
<p>The board will ask shareholders to approve the proposal at a meeting in Cairo on May 12, it added.</p>
<p>The announcement gave no further details and bank officials were not immediately available for comment.</p>
<p>$1=3.395 pounds</p>
<p>-- Cairo newsroom +20 2 578 3290/1</p>
</text>
